---
manual: manip.prepend
lines: [2349, 2349]
testability: api
display: any
expect: fail
reason: Lacci's prepend returns whatever the block returned last, not the slot (ledger row requested)
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $slot = stack { para "second" }
  @go = button("Go") { $returned = $slot.prepend { para "first" } }
end
----------- test code
button("@go").trigger_click
assert_same $slot, $returned, "prepend returns self"
